6a6519b4c27c"],

Cell["\<\
Important provenance warning: \[Delta]_water=4.324 is currently an input \
supplied in the project brief, not a value independently authenticated by the \
sources above. The 3D Ising universality-class benchmark from the bootstrap \
data gives \[Delta]\[TildeTilde]4.78984. If 4.324 comes from a finite-range \
water equation-of-state fit, it must be labelled as that fit's effective \
exponent and accompanied by its original reference, fitting interval, and \
uncertainty; it must not be presented as the asymptotic universal exponent \
without evidence.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"f204d68f-700b-e043-8974-396b91bc4d0a"],

